      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**PX4 SITL -> Kafka -> Flink -> archive -> SQL.** Refresh: 5 s. Current values become Unknown when SQL/source receipt health expires; history remains visible. Chart X axis is native boot seconds, not measurement UTC. Position offsets are a local approximation of estimate changes, not flight distance. This stream contains position; battery is not present. Local recording guard: 1 hour or 3,600 deliveries."
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.2.4"
